  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution to the Post-Conflict Research Centre for the implementation of the project &quot;Bridging the Gap in Bosnia and Herzegovina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Finan&#x10D;n&#xFD; pr&#xED;spevok pre Post-konfliktn&#xE9; v&#xFD;skumn&#xE9; centrum na realiz&#xE1;ciu projektu &#x201E;Premostenie rozdielov v Bosne a Hercegovine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Navrhovan&#xFD; projekt je komplexn&#xFD; transforma&#x10D;n&#xFD; a zmierovac&#xED; projekt, ktor&#xE9;ho hlavn&#xFD;m cie&#x13E;om je hojenie historick&#xFD;ch r&#xE1;n a podpora zjednotenia naprie&#x10D; etnick&#xFD;mi a n&#xE1;bo&#x17E;ensk&#xFD;mi komunitami mlad&#xFD;ch &#x13E;ud&#xED; v BaH prostredn&#xED;ctvom konkr&#xE9;tnych aktiv&#xED;t. Do popredia z&#xE1;ujmu kladie najm&#xE4; zranite&#x13E;n&#xE9; skupiny.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is a comprehensive transformation and reconciliation project whose main objective is to heal historical wounds and promote unification across ethnic and religious communities of young people in BiH through concrete activities. It puts vulnerable groups in particular at the forefront.</narrative>
  </description>
